  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.04 Examination Fees for Microblading Certificates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.04 Examination Fees for Microblading Certificates. The examination fees for cosmetologists and estheticians to obtain a microblading certificate as regulated by the executive director in consultation with the advisory board of body art practitioners under RSA 314-A:2, IV, equivalent to permanent cosmetics or micropigmentation examinations, shall be as follows:\n\n(a) For the written exam, $18; and\n\n(b) For the practical exam, $20.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.03(d))",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
